This repository contains the source code, technical white papers, and
supporting materials of the Sysblade HyperBuffer entry submitted to the
23rd ATCC (All-Taiwan Collegiate Competition) — Topic C13 sponsored by
Sysgration (系統電).

The contents are made publicly viewable for the purpose of competition
review and academic transparency. No license is granted at this stage to
copy, modify, redistribute, or use the contents in derivative works,
whether commercial or non-commercial. A formal open-source license
decision will be made after the competition concludes.

The naming "Sysblade HyperBuffer" is associated with the ATCC entry
sponsored by Sysgration. For inquiries about reuse, please contact the
author via the GitHub profile linked in the repository.
